  "description": "Newly renovated, stunning property!  A bright, spacious apartment in a beautiful period building built in the late 1800's with many original features remaining. An ex convent & School featuring 15ft ceilings and large window openings allowing for floods of natural light.\n\nThe property includes a large, bright open plan living room and a stunning, loft style second bedroom. There is a second double bedroom with storage. The kitchen is modern and bright and the bathroom is newly fitted. The property is furnished to a corporate standard and viewing is highly recommended. Secure parking is available.\n\nThe location benefits from easy access to train station, bus station and the m1 motorway. Departure times to the capital are frequent. travel time to Dublin city centre of 45 minutes and to Belfast 1hr 20 minutes. All conceivable amenities are within walking distance most notably Scotch Hall Shopping centre which sits on your doorstep.",
